WEBVTT

00:00:00.908 --> 00:00:08.836
Namaste. Is video mein chaar naye kaam. Delivery challan, jab maal pehle jaata hai aur bill baad mein.

00:00:08.836 --> 00:00:15.909
Udhaar ki seema. Do lo ek free jaisi scheme. Aur kaante se tola hua maal, label scan karke.

00:00:15.909 --> 00:00:18.319
Ye hardware ka public demo hai.

00:00:18.689 --> 00:00:27.993
More menu mein Delivery challans. New challan. Party list se chuni, maal jodo, kitna gaya, aur site ka pata.

00:00:27.993 --> 00:00:34.540
Goods leave stock now ka matlab maal abhi stock se nikal gaya. Save challan.

00:00:49.324 --> 00:00:54.323
Challan ban gaya, apne number ke saath. WhatsApp par party ko, ya Print.

00:00:54.323 --> 00:00:57.655
Site par jisne liya uska naam bhi likh sakte ho.

00:00:58.033 --> 00:01:05.793
Mahine ke ant mein Challans list. Is party ke do challan bill ke liye baaki hain. Pick all aur Make one bill.

00:01:05.793 --> 00:01:11.844
Dono challan ka maal ek bill mein jud gaya, aaj ke daam par. Stock dobara nahi katta.

00:01:12.208 --> 00:01:17.357
Complete bill aur Fully paid. Bill ban gaya, aur dono challan ab Billed.

00:01:17.357 --> 00:01:21.219
Bill void karo to challan phir se khule ho jaate hain.

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:30.641
Ab udhaar ki seema. Customer ke page par Udhaar limit, Set a limit. Is party ki seema ek hazaar. Save.

00:01:32.463 --> 00:01:35.803
Wahi party phir aayi, drill machine udhaar par.

00:01:35.803 --> 00:01:42.697
Full udhaar dabate hi laal chetavni: pehle se kitna baaki, ye bill kitna jodega, aur seema kitni.

00:01:42.697 --> 00:01:45.114
Faisla aapka, par aankh ke saamne.

00:01:47.987 --> 00:01:55.278
Ab scheme. Offers mein Buy X get Y free. Fevicol par do lo, ek free. Start offer.

00:01:58.396 --> 00:02:03.229
Bill par do Fevicol daalo, to app kehta hai: ek aur jodo, wo free hai.

00:02:03.229 --> 00:02:09.927
Teesra jodte hi ek free, aur paisa sirf do ka. Invoice par free wala alag line mein, zero rupaye.

00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:25.286
Aakhri, kaante ka barcode. Barcode settings mein Weighing scale labels.

00:02:25.286 --> 00:02:32.020
Label kis number se shuru, item code kitne ank ka, aur label mein wazan ya daam.

00:02:32.020 --> 00:02:36.481
Har khule item ka kaante wala code uske barcode mein.

00:02:38.032 --> 00:02:42.186
Kaante ne label chhapa, ek kilo dhaai sau gram binding wire.

00:02:42.186 --> 00:02:46.963
New bill par label scan kiya, aur item sahi wazan ke saath bill mein.

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:58.229
To aaj: delivery challan aur ek bill mein kai challan, udhaar ki seema, do lo ek free jaisi scheme, aur kaante ka label.

00:02:58.229 --> 00:02:59.060
Dhanyavaad.
